# Every source goes through _read_jsonl_cached (mtime/size cache, half-written tail skipped).
# Each bar (confirmed_key) lands in at most ONE tile, in this order of precedence:
#   confirmed  >  verify verdict (unsure / rejected)  >  rejected sound_flip candidate  >  pending.
